### Create a task
POST http://localhost:3000/database/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk"
}

### Create another task
POST http://localhost:3000/database/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Walk the dog"
}

### List all tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/database/tasks

### Get one task by id
GET http://localhost:3000/database/tasks/1

### Mark a task as done
PATCH http://localhost:3000/database/tasks/1/done

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/database/tasks/2

### Get a task that does not exist (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/database/tasks/999
